{"id": "1534178816912658503", "channel_id": "1534178816912658503", "author_id": "705407952575529022", "author_name": "water_heart", "content": "癲狂列車\n根據規則\n釋放鑰令需求銀鑰+50% 也就是1500\n儲存上限為3000\n圖一\n滿3000銀結束戰鬥\n圖二\n戰鬥外發現3000銀被壓到2000銀\n圖三\n戰鬥開始\n因列車規則銀鑰減半\n數據顯示為1000銀 符合圖二的數據\n但有1000銀不見了", "timestamp": "2026-08-04T12:38:53.616000+00:00", "thread_id": "1534178816912658503", "edited_timestamp": "2026-08-04T12:39:04.627000+00:00", "reactions": [{"emoji": "🍟", "emoji_id": null, "count": 4}], "attachments": [{"id": "1534178817357385778", "filename": "Screenshot_2026-08-04-20-13-26-359_com.qookkagames.z1.gp.hk.jpg", "content_type": "image/jpeg", "size": 149144, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1534178816912658503/1534178817357385778/Screenshot_2026-08-04-20-13-26-359_com.qookkagames.z1.gp.hk.jpg?ex=6a73d79d&is=6a72861d&hm=6c4f321a069bd5e21a609f21ca3678682492f83f8df56299b5f2559cae04d329&"}, {"id": "1534178817906704545", "filename": "Screenshot_2026-08-04-20-13-44-612_com.qookkagames.z1.gp.hk.jpg", "content_type": "image/jpeg", "size": 124293, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1534178816912658503/1534178817906704545/Screenshot_2026-08-04-20-13-44-612_com.qookkagames.z1.gp.hk.jpg?ex=6a73d79d&is=6a72861d&hm=31e96cea1c72b34bafbdcfcf3342f0c3740804e6b71aed556f44f926efa8a4f4&"}, {"id": "1534178818376339476", "filename": "Screenshot_2026-08-04-20-14-24-712_com.qookkagames.z1.gp.hk.jpg", "content_type": "image/jpeg", "size": 202282, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1534178816912658503/1534178818376339476/Screenshot_2026-08-04-20-14-24-712_com.qookkagames.z1.gp.hk.jpg?ex=6a73d79d&is=6a72861d&hm=67aa39c863b38bbb3f2d331397b9982585fea432f7e05c6646498293f5c46463&"}], "thread_title": "還我1000銀", "forum_channel_id": "1180845276823564288", "thread_tags": ["1181168103141416960"], "is_thread_starter": true}
{"id": "1534168816270184489", "channel_id": "1534168816270184489", "author_id": "735137568307282011", "author_name": "reya.li", "content": "As title really, all you need to do is play them together in that way. There's some other weird bugs with GLotan's 4 cost but I'm still figuring out the exact reproduction steps with those, I'll try to report later.\n\nBut yeah, any 4 costs created and \"\"set to 0\"\" by Gynoecium stacks being consumed actually get set to a base 1 cost for some esoteric reason.\n\nThe Long Blade in the picture was just drawn in the opening hand so no modifications have happened to it.", "timestamp": "2026-08-04T11:59:09.277000+00:00", "thread_id": "1534168816270184489", "edited_timestamp": "2026-08-04T12:00:36.214000+00:00", "attachments": [{"id": "1534168816953594017", "filename": "image.png", "content_type": "image/png", "size": 2761571, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1534168816270184489/1534168816953594017/image.png?ex=6a73ce4d&is=6a727ccd&hm=55dd4200ca1519c0ba9e74e5dd61d920aba75897dd487e03636a9954195fdcb7&"}], "thread_title": "Lotan: Cetarchon 4 costs created using Saya's Exalt with \"Gynoecium\" stacks are 1 cost not 0", "forum_channel_id": "1180845276823564288", "thread_tags": ["1181168103141416960", "1361168893200044183"], "is_thread_starter": true}
